CharacterBody2D (PlayerBike)
├── Sprite2D (Top-down view of the bike)
├── CollisionPolygon2D (Body hitbox closely hugging the sides)
├── MirrorHitboxLeft (Area2D - Left mirror)
│   └── CollisionShape2D (Small circle)
├── MirrorHitboxRight (Area2D - Right mirror)
│   └── CollisionShape2D (Small circle)
└── Camera2D (Attached with Screen Shake vibration effect)